% layout 'main';
% title 'Word Parser';
<div class="row">
  <div class="col-md-3 mb-4">
    <div class="card mb-3">
      <div class="card-header fw-bold">Word Part Lexicon</div>
      <div class="list-group list-group-flush">
% if (stash('logged_in_user')) {
        <a class="list-group-item list-group-item-action" href="/new">New Entry</a>
% }
        <a class="list-group-item list-group-item-action" href="/search">Search Entries (<%= $entries %>)</a>
        <a class="list-group-item list-group-item-action" href="/parse">Parse a Term</a>
        <a class="list-group-item list-group-item-action" href="/build">Build a Term</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card mb-3">
      <div class="card-header fw-bold">Meta</div>
      <div class="list-group list-group-flush">
% if (stash('logged_in_user')) {
        <a class="list-group-item list-group-item-action" href="/logout">Logout</a>
% } else {
        <a class="list-group-item list-group-item-action" href="/login">Login</a>
% }
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="col-md-9">
    <h1>Word Partition</h1>
    <h2 class="text-muted h4 mb-4">Partition Words into Scored Fragments</h2>

    <div class="mb-4">
      <h3>Words are made of components</h3>
      <p>
      The vast majority of scientific terminology has evolved from Latin and Greek forms.
      A term is made up of ancient roots, prefixes and suffixes. These parts are known as morphemes.
      These morphemes can be saved in a lexicon and used to parse a term into its components.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-4">
      <h3>They can be deconstructed</h3>
      <p>
      A term can be parsed into meaningful morpheme chains.
      There can be many possible chains for a given term, depending on what parts are known (are present in the lexicon).
      Each chain is given a ratio score based on how familiar the partitions are. That is known vs unknown parts.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-4">
      <h3>And they can be synthesized</h3>
      <p>
      Given a definition, a scientific term may be generated.
      There may be a number of possible terms matching a given definition.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
